plication\nShooting Sports Sweepstakes Award Application\nOutstanding Horse Award Application\nHorse Sweepstakes Award Applicatio n\nDillon Jolley Scholarship Application\nDepartments & Offices\nAssessor (Director of Equalization)\nAuditor & Elections\nCommissioners\nEmergency Management\nExtension Office & 4-H Program\nHighway\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans\nWeed\nZoning - County\nZoning - Joint Jurisdiction\nOther Links\nBid & RFP Documents\nCareers & Service Opportunities\nCity of Vermillion\nClay County Fair & Achievement Days\nClay County Historic Preservation\nClay County Ordinances\nClay County Park Campground\nDakota Senior Meals/ROCS\nSDACO\nTownship Information\nUniversity of South Dakota\nVermillion Chamber of Commerce\nVermillion Public Library\nCopyright 2015 Clay County, South Dakota",
